03dCJuq_OC6hp_uMhIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTnY5bm9uZ3lzM3p5QUUaEkNnc0ktN2poMFFZUXdOSzFkdw\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E9%BA%B5%E5%B1%8B+%E5%8D%83%E9%9B%B2+%E6%9E%97%E6%A3%AE%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d5993608452627432944\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKENv9nongys3zyAE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5Wdl5M-91HZvPITkPDYO0eT","0ahUKEwjNl9uAsteWAxXWoa8BHYBWGLkQ544CCDUoIA",null,"2026年6月22日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1585432581869657726/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzNjY0OTQwNzU4MTQ1NjM1NjEx","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1585432581869657726/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzNjY0OTQwNzU4MTQ1NjM1NjEx",null,null,null,null,null,["3664940758145635611","CIHM0ogKENv9nongys3zyAE","CgsI-7jh0QYQwNK1dw"]]],1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[9],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["我們誠摯邀請您品嚐來自日本的正宗拉麵。麵屋千雲堅持呈現最道地的日式風味，主打濃厚雞白湯拉麵與清爽鹽味拉麵，湯頭以長時間熬製，口感濃郁且層次豐富。人氣品項包含招牌雞白湯拉麵、柚子鹽味拉麵與魚介沾麵，深受在地顧客與海外旅客喜愛。\n\n店內同時提供日式煎餃、炸物、小菜與丼飯，適合聚餐或宵夜時段用餐，營業至深夜，是台北宵夜推薦與拉麵名店之一。\n\n本格的な日本スタイルのラーメン専門店。濃厚な鶏白湯そばや柚子香る鶏塩そば、つけそばが人気です。\n\nAuthentic Japanese-style ramen. Known for rich chicken broth ramen (Tori Paitan), yuzu shio ramen, and tsukemen. A popular late-night ramen spot in Taipei.\n\n일본 정통 스타일 라멘 전문점. 닭백탕 라멘과 츠케멘이 인기이며 타이베이 라멘 맛집으로 알려져 있습니다."],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-HxmI3aTK3fM/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/-m2hnvwQ2wc/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],"臺北市中山區正義里",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[null,1],0,null,["評分和評論","分享你的經驗供他人參考",1,"詳細說明你在這個地點的親身體驗"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,